  "performanceScope": "One 45-second measurement after20-second warmup per configuration, reloading the same QA checkpoint. New corpse cleanup and outside-worker recruitment are the variables. Other controls retain the existing user selections. Render intervals are not simulation-frame latency; this small populated city does not establish large-city performance.",
