    "Resource tests exercise native ore extraction and isolated supply/storage fixtures. Other deposits have scheduler/isolation tests; no long-duration economy test.",
    "Overlapping protections and frozen statistics retain the interactions explained in README. No claim of compatibility with every external mod."
  ],
